### 1. Get all movies
GET http://localhost:3000/movies

### 2.Get a specific movie by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/movies/1

### 3. Get a movie that does not exist
GET http://localhost:3000/movies/99

### 4. Create a new movie

POST http://localhost:3000/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Blade Runner",
  "director": "Ridley Scott",
  "year": 1982
}

### 5. Create a new movie with missing fields

POST http://localhost:3000/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "director": "Nobody"
}

### 6. Check all movies after adding new movies

GET http://localhost:3000/movies


### 7. Update a movie
PATCH http://localhost:3000/movies/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "year": 2011
}

###

### 8. Check updated movie
GET http://localhost:3000/movies/1

###

### 9. Delete a movie
DELETE http://localhost:3000/movies/1

###

### 10. Check deleted movie
GET http://localhost:3000/movies/1

