### Test PUT - Replace movie
PUT http://localhost:3000/movies/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Inception Updated",
  "year": 2010,
  "genre": "Sci-Fi"
}

### PATCH - Update only the movie title
PATCH http://localhost:3000/movies/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Inception PATCH Updated"
}

### DELETE - Delete movie with ID 1
DELETE http://localhost:3000/movies/1

###
GET http://localhost:3000/movies?genre=sci-fi

### Get movies from 2010 onwards
GET http://localhost:3000/movies?minYear=2010

### Get Sci-Fi movies from 2000 onwards
GET http://localhost:3000/movies?genre=sci-fi&minYear=2000

### Test invalid minimum year
GET http://localhost:3000/movies?minYear=abc

### Sort movies by year
GET http://localhost:3000/movies?sort=year

### Sort movies by title
GET http://localhost:3000/movies?sort=title

### Test invalid sorting
GET http://localhost:3000/movies?sort=rating

### Test an unknown route
GET http://localhost:3000/unknown

